  "description": "Identifies the suspicious use of AssumeRole. Attackers could move laterally and escalate privileges.",
  "author": "Austin Songer @austinsonger",
  "date": "2021-07-24",
  "tags": [
    "attack.lateral-movement",
    "attack.privilege-escalation",
    "attack.t1548",
